<title>MEXICO: TENNIS-MEXICO WIN DOUBLES TO LEAD ARGENTINA 2-1.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MEXICO WIN DOUBLES TO LEAD ARGENTINA 2-1.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico won the doubles to</p>
<p>take a 2-1 lead over Argentina in their Davis Cup World Group</p>
<p>qualifying tie on Saturday.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Oscar Ortiz/Alejandro Hernandez beat Luis Lobo/Pablo Albano 6-7</p>
<p>(5-7) 6-4 3-6 7-6 (7-2) 6-4</p>
</text>
